{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/BradleyGleavePortfolio/growth-project-backend/pulls/664","id":4723373747,"node_id":"PR_kwDORnQJEs8AAAABGYj2sw","html_url":"https://github.com/BradleyGleavePortfolio/growth-project-backend/pull/664","diff_url":"https://github.com/BradleyGleavePortfolio/growth-project-backend/pull/664.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/BradleyGleavePortfolio/growth-project-backend/pull/664.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/BradleyGleavePortfolio/growth-project-backend/issues/664","number":664,"state":"open","locked":false,"title":"fix(deps): bump multer 2.3.0 -> 2.4.0 (GHSA-3pph-fpjx-jg34)","user":{"login":"BradleyGleavePortfolio","id":264851314,"node_id":"U_kgDOD8lPcg","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/264851314?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/BradleyGleavePortfolio","html_url":"https://github.com/BradleyGleavePortfolio","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BradleyGleavePortfolio/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BradleyGleavePortfolio/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BradleyGleavePortfolio/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BradleyGleavePortfolio/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BradleyGleavePortfolio/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BradleyGleavePortfolio/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BradleyGleavePortfolio/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BradleyGleavePortfolio/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BradleyGleavePortfolio/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"## Tier header\n- **Tier:** T3 (production dependency + lockfile change).\n- **Why:** raises the consumer-scoped override `\"@nestjs/platform-express@11.1.26\": { \"multer\": \"2.3.0\" }` to `2.4.0`, the release that fixes GHSA-3pph-fpjx-jg34 / CVE-2026-88932 (moderate: DoS through orphaned disk writes on aborted uploads; vulnerable `>=2.2.0 <2.4.0`). multer is a prod dependency (lockfile `node_modules/multer`, no dev flag).\n- **T4 trigger scan:** none (no workflow, scripts/ci, branch protection or gate file).\n- **T3 trigger scan:** yes, a prod dependency and package-lock.json. No app code, schema, migration, auth, RLS or payments change.\n- **Behaviour:** no app behaviour change expected. No route in `src/` uses multer (`rg` for FileInterceptor / FilesInterceptor / AnyFilesInterceptor / UploadedFile / MulterModule / `from 'multer'` finds nothing). The HelloSign webhook parses its multipart body itself (`src/contracts/webhooks/hellosign-webhook.controller.ts`). multer 2.4.0 does change some edge behaviour (limits checked at construction, non-integer `fileSize` rejected, `limits.parts` off-by-one fixed, filename added to file errors: [v2.4.0 release](https://github.com/expressjs/multer/releases/tag/v2.4.0)). None of these paths is wired in this app today. If an upload route ever uses multer, re-grade.\n- **Bounded T1:** none.\n- **Builder-owner:** lane B-AUDIT-GATE (operator agent 114), item 2. Builder does not audit or merge.\n- **Promotion triggers:** any multer-backed route in the diff; any change beyond the 4 files below.\n\n## Change\n- `package.json`: override `multer` 2.3.0 -> 2.4.0 (still scoped to `@nestjs/platform-express@11.1.26`).\n- `package-lock.json` (from `npm install --package-lock-only --ignore-scripts`): `node_modules/multer` 2.4.0 (integrity `sha512-7dqa0Zc...vhg==`, checked against the `npm pack multer@2.4.0` tarball). `concat-stream` is removed because multer 2.4.0 dropped it. `buffer-from` and `readable-stream` become `dev: true` because their only prod consumer was concat-stream. No other entry changes.\n- `test/dependency-compatibility.spec.ts`: patched floor for multer major 2 raised to `2.4.0`, exact pinned resolution raised to `2.4.0`.\n- `docs/dependencies/2026-09-op81-dependency-repair.md`: override row updated with the new advisory, source link and removal condition (`multer >= 2.4.0`). Table re-aligned by prettier.\n\n## Tests\n- Fail-before: `npx jest test/dependency-compatibility.spec.ts --runInBand` against the shared install (multer 2.3.0) fails with `@nestjs/platform-express -> multer@2.3.0 is below patched floor 2.4.0`. CI installs from this lockfile, so there it resolves 2.4.0.\n- Upload-path specs: `test/dependency-compatibility.spec.ts` multipart probe (success, truncated body -> \"Unexpected end of form\", `LIMIT_FILE_SIZE`) passes. `test/contracts/hellosign-webhook.controller.spec.ts` passes. Locally 13 of 14 tests across the two files pass; the one failure is the fail-before floor test above (shared install still has 2.3.0).\n- The same multipart probe run directly against the multer 2.4.0 tarball contents: `multer 2.4.0 probe OK: success, truncated, LIMIT_FILE_SIZE`.\n- `npm audit --package-lock-only` (whole graph) on this lockfile: moderate 0, high 3 (only the braces / micromatch / danger chain), so GHSA-3pph-fpjx-jg34 is gone.\n\n## Required checks note\n#663 (audit gate exception for the unpatchable dev-only braces advisory) is merged. This branch merged main 2e3094b9 (merge commit 62f57edb), so the audit check now evaluates through the gate. The local gate run on this lockfile passes, with only the braces exception applied and no moderate findings left.\n\n## Acceptance evidence\nCI at the head (build-and-test runs the full suite against a clean `npm ci` of this lockfile).\n\n## Fix round\n| Finding | Change | Commit | Test |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| (none yet) | | | |\n","created_at":"2026-10-03T02:09:11Z","updated_at":"2026-10-04T02:49:03Z","closed_at":null,"merged_at":null,"merge_commit_sha":"9a8f19f1a200e55241edc091f83dba1badccdd7f","assignees":[],"requested_reviewers":[],"requested_teams":[],"labels":[{"id":11279128785,"node_id":"LA_kwDORnQJEs8AAAACoEnY0Q","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/BradleyGleavePortfolio/growth-proj